{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46173","headline":"避地毘陵寒月上孙徽使君兼寄东阳王使君三首 一 · 贯休","name":"避地毘陵寒月上孙徽使君兼寄东阳王使君三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一到毘陵心更劳，冷吟闲步拥云袍。\n岂缘思妙尘埃少，自是风清物态高。\n野色疎黄连楚甸，故山奇碧隔河桥。\n终须愚谷中安致，不是人间好羽毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}